      "date": "2026-04-18T05:03:17.000Z",
      "title": "KIRLOSENG: Upcoming Chairman Transition And Minor Assumption Tweaks Will Shape Balanced Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained their fair value estimate for Kirloskar Oil Engines at ₹1,546.20, with only small tweaks to inputs such as discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin, and future P/E assumptions informing this unchanged price target. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on Feb 11, 2026 at 15:00 Indian Standard Time to consider and approve standalone and consolidated unaudited financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025, to consider declaration of an interim dividend for FY 2025-26, and to approve allotment of 9,074 fully paid up equity shares of ₹2 each upon exercise of employee stock options (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
